# GitHub Pages

This app is a **static** SPA on GitHub Pages. There is no server and no runtime backend.

## Must

- Production Vite `base` is `/ft-ai-4-presentations/` until a custom domain or user-site repo is confirmed.
- Asset URLs use `import.meta.env.BASE_URL` or bundled imports. Never root-absolute `/images/...`.
- Slide state stays on reveal.js URL hashes. Do not add `BrowserRouter` path routes unless a Pages 404 fallback is implemented and documented.
- Deploy via GitHub Actions building `dist/`. Do not commit secrets. `VITE_*` values are public.

## Must not

- Node/Express/serverless as part of the site
- reveal.js speaker-notes **server** (incompatible with Pages)
- Hosting our own multiplex Socket.IO on Pages (use `https://multiplex.up.railway.app/`)
- Shipping the multiplex master `secret` in the Pages build
- Assuming the site is hosted at `/`
- Migrating the SPA to Vercel unless the Memory Bank decision is revisited

See `memory-bank/github-pages.md` and `memory-bank/multiplex.md`.
